# build-selection -- enter the grid sequencer's DURABLE row-range selection modal
# (modal(selectionActive)) via nav-mode shift+encoder on the focused column.
# Plan: nav home->scope->sequencer, then build_selection (down SHIFT, turn 3,
# up SHIFT). self.selectionActive INITIALIZES false, so modal(selectionActive) is
# a clean ABSENT->PRESENT boundary that PERSISTS (durable) until UP/CANCEL/column-
# change -- UNLIKE the TRANSIENT modal(editingL1) (set_cell), stripped as non-
# durable, and UNLIKE the always-truthy markingMode idle-string quirk. This is the
# goal that moves the `modal` fluent type into coverage. [stol:ui-planner-cov-modals]
context(sequencer)
modal(selectionActive)
